## Judgment

No material regression on realistic data. The letter+letterless fusion
edge case (§1) and the spaced-double-ampersand inconsistency (§2) are
real, honestly-hunted findings but both require narrow, uncommon
description patterns with no live-data or fixture evidence behind them —
the same evidentiary bar the P5 residual itself was held to before being
accepted and scheduled as this very task. The P10 ruling's stated goal
(close the P5 {H,M}-style two-letter-brand bridge, unify spaced/unspaced
spellings) is achieved and verified by hand-trace plus direct execution;
no panic/index issues; idempotent; deterministic under race+repeat; full
repo green. PASS, with the two edge cases logged as non-blocking nits for
a future punch-list ruling (same pattern P5 -> P10 already used
successfully).
